  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e0d8dd5b8f33e34b965fec3f1ff8d3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: L1218_DropsMultipleItemsAtOnce
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exerciseNumber: 18
  exerciseName: DropsMultipleItemsAtOnce
  exerciseTitle: Drops multiple items at once
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458707
  exerciseText: Drops multiple items at once
  hintText: How many times is the F key being pressed? Just once per key press? Or
    not?
  solutionText: Input logic is testing for isPressed which is true for every single
    Update while the key is held down. Whereas in this case we just want it to be
    true for a single frame when we press the key, so here we should instead use
    wasPressedThisFrame.
